{"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/Readium\/documentation\/ReadiumShared\/BufferingResource","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/Readium\/documentation\/ReadiumShared"]]},"relationshipsSections":[{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/Readium\/documentation\/ReadiumShared\/Loggable","doc:\/\/Readium\/documentation\/ReadiumShared\/Resource","doc:\/\/Readium\/documentation\/ReadiumShared\/Streamable","doc:\/\/Readium\/s8SendableP","doc:\/\/Readium\/s16SendableMetatypeP","doc:\/\/Readium\/ScA"],"type":"conformsTo","kind":"relationships","title":"Conforms To"}],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"text":"actor","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"BufferingResource","kind":"identifier"}],"platforms":["iOS","iPadOS","Mac Catalyst"]}]},{"content":[{"type":"heading","text":"Overview","anchor":"overview","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Expensive interaction with the underlying resource is minimized, since most"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"(smaller) requests can be satisfied by accessing the buffer alone. The"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"drawback is that some extra space is required to hold the buffer and that"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"copying takes place when filling that buffer, but this is usually"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"outweighed by the performance benefits."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Note that this implementation is pretty limited and the benefits are only"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"apparent when reading forward and consecutively – e.g. when downloading the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"resource by chunks. The buffer is ignored when reading backward or far"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"ahead."}]}],"kind":"content"}],"variants":[{"traits":[{"int